as suggested by the chef.

00:06:04.364 --> 00:06:05.578
(glasses clinking)

00:06:05.578 --> 00:06:06.846
(calm piano music)

00:06:06.846 --> 00:06:08.078
Wow, I've already learned, today,

00:06:08.078 --> 00:06:10.663
