00:06:16.007 --> 00:06:17.586
surpassed again in my life.

00:06:17.586 --> 00:06:22.513
The most expensive pizza tip
touch that's ever occurred.

00:06:22.513 --> 00:06:23.529
- Here we go.

00:06:23.529 --> 00:06:26.446
(calm piano music)

00:06:35.539 --> 00:06:37.538
- [Steven] That's an indescribable taste.

00:06:37.538 --> 00:06:39.251
You've already eaten half the pizza.

00:06:39.251 --> 00:06:40.822
- Yeah, I like pizza.

00:06:40.822 --> 00:06:43.252
- This is the best pizza I've
ever had in my entire life.

00:06:43.252 --> 00:06:45.565
