00:06:51.480 --> 00:06:52.984
That smell is my dinner.

00:06:52.984 --> 00:06:53.817
(expletive beeping)

00:06:53.817 --> 00:06:55.203
- It's a once in a lifetime experience.

00:06:55.203 --> 00:06:56.695
- Finally I've found a pizza that

00:06:56.695 --> 00:06:59.740
makes me slow down and enjoy each bite.

00:06:59.740 --> 00:07:02.283
- We did it. We slowed Andrew down.

00:07:02.283 --> 00:07:04.240
- I got us some candy corn for dessert,

00:07:04.240 --> 00:07:05.530
'cause we're best friends now.

00:07:05.530 --> 00:07:07.469
(laughing)

00:07:07.469 --> 00:07:08.302
(surprised grunt)

00:07:08.302 --> 00:07:09.925
- Which value was worth it the most?

00:07:09.925 --> 00:07:12.114
- The five dollar pizza was amazing.

00:07:12.114 --> 00:07:14.013
But it was a little to formulae.

00:07:14.013 --> 00:07:16.107
I would go with Mozza. They've really

00:07:16.107 --> 00:07:17.975
honed and perfected that craft.

00:07:17.975 --> 00:07:20.820
- Spago was truly an
out of body experience.

00:07:20.820 --> 00:07:22.358
But that wasn't a pizza, that was

00:07:22.358 --> 00:07:25.159
